       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PB4745S.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-REQUESTOR USAGE MESSAGE-TAG.
       01 WS-REQUEST   PIC X(8).
       01 WS-LEN       PIC 9(4).
       01 WS-REPLY     PIC X(8) VALUE "BAL=0100".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-P.
           RECEIVE WS-REQUESTOR GIVING WS-REQUEST WS-LEN
           END-RECEIVE.
           SEND TO WS-REQUESTOR FROM WS-REPLY
           END-SEND.
           STOP RUN.
